    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0560" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg464"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Baron de Fava.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September 21,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Answering the inquiry contained in your telegram of to-day to Mr. Adee, I have to
                    say that the judge’s report to the governor does not give the date when the next
                    grand jury will meet. I have asked the governor by telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">David J. Hill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
